    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρῡσώρῠχ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρύσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>digging for gold,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρμηκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.1.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					6.166
				</span></i>
			 (Phrygia, <span class="entity">iv A. D.</span>): as Subst.,
				<i>gold-miner,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Zos.Alch.
				p.240B.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσώρυφος.</span></div>
